### mcp_resource_list

List the resources of an MCP server. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.

---

### mcp_resource_templates

List the resource templates of an MCP server. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.

---

### mcp_resource_read

Read an MCP resource by URI. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Copy an exact URI from mcp_resource_list or mcp_resource_templates. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.

---

### mcp_resource_subscribe

Subscribe to update notifications for an MCP resource. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Copy an exact URI from mcp_resource_list. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.

---

### mcp_resource_unsubscribe

Stop update notifications for an MCP resource. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Copy an exact URI from mcp_resource_list. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.

