### mcp_prompt_get

Get an MCP prompt and its messages. Before using it, run tool_discovery with kind="mcp" (or an MCP server name as source) to connect the servers, then pass the exact server name of an mcp status row. Copy an exact prompt name from mcp_prompt_list. Configured secrets are redacted from the result.
